ap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1622701352082"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>#ソーシャル・インパクト・デザイン　#京都　#デザイン集団</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1622701374558" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1622701374558" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1622700110517" data-id="1622700110517"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1622701374455" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1622701374455" data-resolution="480x480"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/3eec5066-af54-48d3-a010-6c7970a197dd/-/format/auto/-/preview/480x480/-/quality/lighter/We%E3%81%AE%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD.jpeg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="294" natural-height="480"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1622700112757" data-id="1622700112757"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1622701374460" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1622701374460"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h3>Weの市民革命</h3></div></div><div data-label="Icon" data-key="icon" id="e-1622701374517" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-icon" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1622701374517"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap" style="color: rgb(144, 169, 127);"><i class="gf_icon fa fa-minus"></i></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1622701374452" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1622701374452"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>トランプ時代、パンデミック、ブラック・ライブズ・マター、大統領選……</p><p>いまアメリカで沸きあがる、「私たち」のムーブメント。</p><p>ロングセラー『ヒップな生活革命』の“その先”のストーリー。</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1622701374491" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1622701374491"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><u><a href="https://www.asahipress.com/bookdetail_norm/9784255012032/" class="" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message">公式Webサイトを見る</a></u></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1622701374581" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1622701374581"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>#サステナブル　#市民革命　#本</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1625125555381" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1625125555381"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1625125555435" data-id="1625125555435"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1625125559107" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1625125559107"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1><strong>カポックノットは、ブランド独自の基準として「サステナブルアクション」を導入し、</strong><strong style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">日々の活動の見直しや改善を行なっています。</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1625125564549" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="